		(descr "System-5 30-pin bus edge connector (Eagle's C30), 0.1 in pitch: pad 1 +5V (VCC) to pad 30 GND. The part is a single-row right-angle pin header: its plastic body (drawn on F.Fab) lies on the board between the pads and the card edge, 1.5 to 4.04 mm from the pads, on this footprint's +y side (the card edge, with the bus edge on the left as drawn and the footprint at -90; the pin names are on the other side); its pins run on past the edge. Nothing is printed under the body (2026-11-18).")
